WEBVTT

00:00:01.941 --> 00:00:04.517
Every project starts the same way.

00:00:04.757 --> 00:00:05.847
A blank screen...

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:07.963
and a problem nobody has solved yet.

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:11.873
I'm Mohammad Makki.

00:00:11.893 --> 00:00:14.348
I build AI systems for real businesses,

00:00:14.368 --> 00:00:15.184
from Lebanon.

00:00:18.741 --> 00:00:20.855
A trading platform that reads the signal...

00:00:20.875 --> 00:00:22.720
and places the trade on its own.

00:00:24.556 --> 00:00:26.968
AI agents that answer customers on WhatsApp,

00:00:26.988 --> 00:00:29.641
and chatbots that live on real storefronts.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:33.866
Brand films,

00:00:33.893 --> 00:00:35.826
directed with generative AI.

00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:42.869
Stores built down to the last detail,

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:44.511
in Arabic and English.

00:00:46.699 --> 00:00:48.343
More than a hundred projects.

00:00:48.363 --> 00:00:49.068
Live,

00:00:49.088 --> 00:00:50.290
with real customers.

00:00:52.799 --> 00:00:53.504
I ship,

00:00:53.524 --> 00:00:54.400
not pitch.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.078
AI that earns rent.

00:00:56.127 --> 00:00:57.632
Details are the product.

00:01:00.941 --> 00:01:02.258
Mohammad Makki.

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:03.387
Let's build yours.
